# Wave T38 (Driftlog kit): anchor (prop) — FLOAT KID WREN's fence: a wrought-iron anchor standing upright in the raft grass, stock across, flukes buried, a rope coil at its foot. Three stand in a row flanking his post — the fence his own dialogue records ("My house has an anchor instead of a fence"). Fully opaque, town grass baked in. (WAVE-T38-DRIFTLOG-PLAN.md §3.6/§5.)
